# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# ktask operational state. The configuration files in .ktask/ are versioned;
# the queue and logs are per-run state and must never be committed.
.ktask/queue/
.ktask/logs/
# The queue is rewritten in place as tasks complete ([DONE]/[FAIL] markers).
# Tracking it would dirty the tree after every task, sweep progress markers
# into the agent's own commits, and let an agent edit its own task list.
.ktask/tasks.md

# insta writes these when a snapshot test fails; they must never be committed
# and must never dirty the tree between tasks.
*.snap.new
